  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' I think the demons are coming from somewhere under the old cathedral.'
    portugueseLine: "Acho que os dem\xF4nios est\xE3o vindo de algum lugar do subsolo
      da antiga catedral"
    chineseLine: "\u6211\u89C9\u5F97\u6076\u9B54\u6765\u81EA\u65E7\u5927\u6559\u5802\u5730\u4E0B\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Creo que los demonios vienen de alg\xFAn lugar bajo la antigua
      catedral."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Yes. The cathedral was built on the site of Lucifer\u2019s fall.
      It\u2019s the fastest way out of Hell."
    portugueseLine: "Sim. A catedral foi constru\xEDda em cima do local de queda
      de L\xFAcifer. \xC9 a forma mais r\xE1pida de sair do inferno."
    chineseLine: "\u6CA1\u9519\u3002\u6559\u5802\u5EFA\u5728\u8DEF\u897F\u6CD5\u5760\u843D\u5730\u70B9\u4E0A\u3002\u8FD9\u662F\u6700\u5FEB\u9003\u51FA\u5730\u72F1\u7684\u65B9\u6CD5\u3002"
    spanishLine: " S\xED. La catedral se construy\xF3 sobre el lugar de la ca\xEDda
      de Lucifer. Es la forma m\xE1s r\xE1pida de salir del infierno."
